Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:30:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix model download stall and rebuild chat/setup UI

- Download: stop forcing unmetered-only; add "any network" option, preflight
  server check (HTTP errors, storage), persisted download id and completion
  flag so partial files are never loaded, real failure reasons.
- UI: setup card with progress/speed/cancel/retry, state kept across tabs,
  chat bubbles, auto-scroll, keyboard handling, voice text goes to chat.
- Manifest: dark theme, no activity recreation on rotation.

